    "detailed_description": "&quot;Let's begin your own story.&quot;<br>This is a text-based idle RPG game.<br>There are already more than 3,000 unique story actions and it's still growing.<br><br><u>Game Features</u><br>- Action buttons to select what to do and enhance abilities<br>- Automated battles in Dungeon<br>- A system to summon monsters and strengthen them<br>- Skill and Equipment for summoned monsters<br>- An upgrade system called Routine with offline bonus<br>- A system to automate Action and Dungeon<br>Other features can be unlocked as you progress through the game.<br><br><u>System Features</u>.<br>- A multi-ending system where the ending changes depending on your choices.<br>- Offline bonus allows the progress made when the game is closed to be reproduced when the game is launched.<br><br><u>Story</u><br>You'll start this game from the village.<br>Your father says &quot;Be strong, and save your mother.&quot;.<br>Clear many quests and battle against monsters to be strong.<br>Making friends may be good for your journey.<br>Everything starts from here.<br><br><u>Controls</u><br>Click the buttons to select action.<br>Read the help section in game for detail.",
